      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْجَرُ</span></b> ; and its fem., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجْرَآءُ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجِيرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also
(K) <i>Containing more</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَر</span> [i. e. <i>trees,</i> or <i>shrubs</i>]:
(S, K:) so in the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذِهِ الأَرْضُ أَشْجَرُ مِنْ هٰذِهِ</span>
